# Theme (Otterscale)

Full spec: [`docs/theme.md`](../../docs/theme.md). Implement tokens in `app/globals.css` via Tailwind v4 `@theme`.

## Non‑negotiables

- Canvas `#f2f0eb` (warm parchment); text `#292827`; borders `#e3e3e2`.
- Primary filled CTA: `#421d24` + white text only—no second chromatic button fill.
- Links / “Learn more”: `#714cb6` only—never violet on buttons or badges.
- Secondary actions: lilac fill `#d4c7ff` + `#292827` text + 1px charcoal border, 8px radius.
- Headlines ≥28px: weight **460**, not 700. Display 48–64px with tight negative tracking per theme doc.
- No card `box-shadow`; floating hero cards use ~85% white + light border, no shadow.
- `#0c4243` only on full-bleed dark bands—not cards or chrome.
- Do not use `prefers-color-scheme: dark` for Otterscale marketing/product shell unless explicitly requested.

## Typography

- Stack: Super Sans VF, fallback **Inter** via `next/font` until VF is available.
- Body 16px / lh 1.2 / weight 460 on parchment.

## Layout

- Content max-width 1200px centered; section gaps 64–96px; card padding 16px.
- Sticky header: 64px, `backdrop-filter: blur(12px)`, bottom border on scroll.

## Tailwind usage

Prefer token-backed utilities after `@theme` registration (e.g. `bg-warm-parchment`, `text-ink-charcoal`, `bg-midnight-wine`). Avoid hard-coded `#171717`, Geist-default neutrals, or generic `gray-*` for product UI.

## Example — primary button

```tsx
<button
  type="button"
  className="inline-flex h-12 items-center gap-2 rounded-2xl bg-midnight-wine px-5 text-base font-[460] text-paper-white"
>
  Get started
</button>
```

## Example — inline link

```tsx
<a
  href="/learn"
  className="font-[460] text-royal-violet no-underline transition-[text-decoration] duration-200 hover:underline"
>
  Learn more
</a>
```
